  "description": "Fakhar Black by Lattafa is a fresh, aromatic, woody-spicy masculine fragrance with a modern, confident, and highly versatile character. It opens with crisp apple, bergamot, and ginger, delivering a bright, energetic, clean first impression. The heart introduces lavender, sage, juniper berries, and geranium, adding an aromatic freshness with subtle spice. The base settles into tonka bean, amberwood, vetiver, and cedar, creating a smooth, masculine dry-down with excellent everyday wearability. This fragrance is ideal for customers who enjoy clean modern men’s scents that work effortlessly for work, casual wear, and nights out.",
